                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 5,
                            "last_played": 1649303351
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its really bad, it could be a puzzle game if everything wasn't so half-baked. The walls aren't even solid, the blocks only stack 1/3 of the time (randomly) the ball goes through blocks more then it collides with them. Explosive blocks are too strong such that you can just press \"E\" and click and propel the block that way ignoring any idea of a puzzle which could be decent if things stacked properly and weren't as bouncy. in the game for some reason you are limited to 4 of each block type which doesn't make sense and limits any creative solutions that don't just involve 50 explosive boxes which are unlimited. The achievement spam is probably why this game even exists and its in the way in actual game play. There are tons of free physics puzzle games out there that are leagues above what this is doing.",
